+主实验首先应确认：
+
+cat "$OUTPUTDIR/candidates/balanced/MODEL_INFERENCE_CONTRACT.json"
+cat "$OUTPUTDIR/candidates/precision/MODEL_INFERENCE_CONTRACT.json"
+cat "$OUTPUTDIR/SAFE_REGIME_STATUS.json" 2>/dev/null || true
+
+四、只有 RC=0 才运行自动授权的 Safe paired 和 held-out stress
