+主要输出：
+
+$OUTPUTDIR/dev_shadow_closed_loop/DIAGNOSTIC_ONLY_NO_PAPER.json
+$OUTPUTDIR/dev_shadow_closed_loop/DEV_SHADOW_COMPLETE.json
+$OUTPUTDIR/dev_shadow_closed_loop/balanced/near_dev_shadow_paired.json
